  "body": "We should remove the unstable feature flags that were part of the r0.5.0 release cycle. These are:\r\n\r\n* `m.require_identity_server` (https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/5972)\r\n* `m.id_access_token` (https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/5974)\r\n* `m.separate_add_and_bind` (https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/6044)\r\n\r\nClients that rely on these flags should check for Client Server API r0.6.0 support instead.\r\n\r\nWe should remove all the deprecated endpoints. These are:\r\n\r\n* `/account/3pid` - replaced by `/account/3pid/add` and `/account/3pid/bind`\r\n* Others...",
